content.user_prompt:
Subject: {{subject}}
Difficulty: {{difficulty}}
QuestionType: {{question_type}}
Count: {{count}}
Context chunks:
{{chunks_json}}
Revision feedback: {{revision_feedback}}
Previous questions: {{previous_questions_json}}

Return ONLY a JSON array.

If QuestionType = FE, each object must be:
{
  "type": "FE",
  "topic_tags": ["..."],
  "difficulty": "Easy|Medium|Hard",
  "title": "...",
  "description": "...",
  "source_chunk_ids": ["chunk-..."],
  "skeleton_code": null,
  "solution_code": null,
  "test_cases": null,
  "options": ["A. ...", "B. ...", "C. ...", "D. ..."],
  "correct_answer": ["A"],
  "explanation": "..."
}

If QuestionType = PE, each object must be:
{
  "type": "PE",
  "topic_tags": ["..."],
  "difficulty": "Easy|Medium|Hard",
  "title": "...",
  "description": "...",
  "source_chunk_ids": ["chunk-..."],
  "skeleton_code": [
    {
      "filename": "Main.java or main.c",
      "content": "...",
      "is_readonly": false
    }
  ],
  "solution_code": [
    {
      "filename": "Main.java or main.c",
      "content": "..."
    }
  ],
  "test_cases": [
    {
      "input": "...",
      "expected_output": "...",
      "is_hidden": false
    }
  ],
  "options": null,
  "correct_answer": null,
  "explanation": null
}

Rules:
- Use only information grounded in the provided chunks.
- source_chunk_ids must reference chunk ids that exist in the input.
- For FE, correct_answer must contain option labels such as ["A"] or ["B"].
- For PE, test_cases must include at least 1 visible case and preferably 1 hidden case.
- Do not omit fields.
- Do not return placeholder nulls for required fields.
